  "factor_name": "Blended Momentum with Downside-Risk Adjustment",
  "version": "1.0",
  "calculation": {
    "expression": "0.5 * rank(cumulative_return_20d) + 0.5 * rank(cumulative_return_20d / downside_deviation_20d)",
    "description": "Cross-sectional average of 20-session price momentum rank and 20-session momentum divided by downside deviation rank. Downside deviation is the square root of the rolling mean squared negative daily returns; larger values indicate stronger momentum after downside-risk adjustment. Signals are computed only from completed observations and predict forward 10-session returns."
